00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:16.980
The frogs never leave the pot until they boil to death. So, how does Anastasia boil? Let's see.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:22.160
Step One: The cult recruiter gets the target to say yes to a non-threatening event.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:26.380
