00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:26.680
This is when the cult showers attention, praise, even gifts on the target.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:32.900
Basically, they're trying to create a positive association  in the target's brain between the cult and feeling good.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:38.520
That way, when the opportunity to spend time together comes up again, the target'll be more likely to say YES.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:44.640
In Fifty Shades, starting with that coffee, Grey turns his charm beam fully onto Ana,

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:50.140
asking about her family, giving her food. And the next day, what does Anna find on her doorstep?

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:57.460
